s/frfritt123.png\" /></span>\r\n<div class=\"col_payment_box_txt\">Livraisons rapides avec UPS</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col_payment_box\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sharkspeed.se/uploads/images/Boots/oppetkop123.png\" /></span>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col_payment_box_txt\">Ouvert Acheter 30 jours</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col_payment_box\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sharkspeed.se/uploads/images/Boots/lagstaprisgrnti123.png\" /></span>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col_payment_box_txt\">Garantie du prix le plus bas</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col_payment_box\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sharkspeed.se/uploads/images/Boots/measurererer.png\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 17px;\" /></span>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col_payment_box_txt\">V&ecirc;tements sur mesure</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\";}', '', 'a:7:{s:7:\"Swedish\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"Norwegian\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"Danish\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"Finnish\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"English\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"German\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"French\";s:0:\"\";}', '', 0),
(50, 'box18', 'a:7:{s:7:\"Swedish\";s:14:\"Order Mail top\";s:9:\"Norwegian\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"Danish\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"Finnish\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"English\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"German\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"French\";s:0:\"\";}', '', 'a:7:{s:7:\"Swedish\";s:368:\"<h2>Orderbekr&auml;ftelse<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<b style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Hej!</b></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Tack f&ouml;r att du har handlat hos oss. H&auml;r kommer en bekr&auml;ftelse p&aring; din best&auml;llning. Vi hoppas att du blir n&ouml;jd med dina varor. Du kommer att f&aring; ett nytt e-postmeddelande fr&aring;n oss n&auml;r dina varor &auml;r p&aring; v&auml;g.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\";s:9:\"Norwegian\";s:298:\"<h2>Ordrebekreftelse<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<b style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Hej!</b></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Takk for at du handler hos oss. Her er en bekreftelse p&aring; bestillingen din. Vi h&aring;per du blir forn&oslash;yd med varene dine. Du vil motta en ny e-post fra oss n&aring;r varene dine er p&aring; vei.</p>\r\n\";s:6:\"Danish\";s:300:\"<h2>Ordrebekr&aelig;ftelse<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<b style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Hej!</b></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Tak fordi du handlede hos os. Her er en bekr&aelig;ftelse p&aring; din ordre. Vi h&aring;ber du bliver tilfreds med dine varer. Du vil modtage endnu en e-mail fra os, n&aring;r dine varer er p&aring; vej.</p>\r\n\";s:7:\"Finnish\";s:301:\"<h2>Tilausvahvistus<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<b style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Hei!</b></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Kiitos kun shoppailit kanssamme. T&auml;ss&auml; on vahvistus tilauksestasi. Toivomme, ett&auml; olet tyytyv&auml;inen tuotteisiisi. Saat meilt&auml; uuden s&auml;hk&ouml;postiviestin, kun tuotteet ovat matkalla.</p>\r\n\";s:7:\"English\";s:286:\"<h2>Order confirmation<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<b style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Hi there!</b></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Thank you for shopping with us. Here is a confirmation of your order. We hope you will be satisfied with your goods. You will receive another email from us when your items are on their way.</p>\r\n\";s:6:\"German\";s:320:\"<h2>Auftragsbest&auml;tigung<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<b style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Hallo!</b></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Vielen Dank f&uuml;r Ihren Einkauf bei uns. Hier ist eine Best&auml;tigung Ihrer Bestellung. Wir hoffen, dass Sie mit Ihrer Ware zufrieden sind. Sie erhalten eine weitere E-Mail von uns, wenn Ihre Artikel unterwegs sind.</p>\r\n\";s:6:\"French\";s:342:\"<h2>Confirmation de commande<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<b style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Salut!</b></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Merci d&#39;avoir effectu&eacute; vos achats chez nous. Voici une confirmation de votre commande. Nous esp&eacute;rons que vous serez satisfait de vos produits. Vous recevrez un autre e-mail de notre part lorsque vos articles seront en route.</p>\r\n\";}', '', 'a:7:{s:7:\"Swedish\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"Norwegian\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"Danish\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"Finnish\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"English\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"German\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"French\";s:0:\"\";}', '', 0),
(51, 'box19', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:11:\"Order Mail \";}', '', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:305:\"<p>If you have any questions about your order, please contact our customer service. Remember that you always have a 30-day money-back guarantee. Does not apply to custom-made products. Best regards // Twinkle Star Baby Care<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith best regards // <strong>Twinkle Star Baby Care</strong></p>\r\n\";}', '', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:0:\"\";}', '', 0);
