(261, 'Trustpilot', 'Trustpilot review', 'helpdesk', 'helpdesk@sharkspeed.com', 'helpdesk@sharkspeed.com', 'SnÃ¤lla ge oss ett omdÃ¶me - Vi tackar dig fÃ¶r din order', 'Hej<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Tack &auml;nnu en g&aring;ng f&ouml;r att du har valt Sharkspeed.<br />\r\nF&ouml;r att f&ouml;rb&auml;ttra tillfredsst&auml;llelsen hos v&aring;ra kunder, samarbetar vi med omd&ouml;mesportalen Trustpilot.<br />\r\nDetta tar endast n&aring;gra f&aring; sekunder men har en enorm betydelse f&ouml;r oss.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><a href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/evaluate/sharkspeed.se?stars=5\">KLICKA H&Auml;R F&Ouml;R ATT BETYGS&Auml;TTA OSS P&Aring; TRUSTPILOT</a></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span font-size:=\"\" helvetica=\"\" style=\"font-family: \"><a href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/evaluate/sharkspeed.se?stars=5\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sharkspeed.com/uploads/images/Screenshot_2019-09-04_at_09.20.42.png\" style=\"width: 272px; height: 235px;\" /></a></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Alla omd&ouml;men, vare sig bra eller d&aring;liga, visas omg&aring;ende.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTack f&ouml;r din tid.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Med v&auml;nliga h&auml;lsningar<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSHARKSPEED</strong></span></span>', 'letter', 0, 1, '2019-03-06 16:44:23'),
