(1406, 124, 'return', 'a:2:{s:7:\"English\";s:790:\"We offer standard delivery within 3&ndash;5 business days across the UAE, with express options available in select areas (1&ndash;2 business days). International shipping typically takes 7&ndash;14 business days depending on location. Shipping charges are calculated at checkout, and tracking details are sent via email once your order is dispatched. If you&#39;re not satisfied with your purchase, you can return it within 14 days of delivery. Items must be unused, unwashed, and in their original packaging with tags intact. Exchanges are available for size or color variations, subject to stock availability. Please note that customized items and undergarments are non-returnable. Refunds are processed to the original payment method within 5&ndash;7 business days after return approval.\";s:6:\"Arabic\";s:0:\"\";}'),
(1407, 124, 'ldesc', 'a:2:{s:7:\"English\";s:415:\"The garments labelled as Committed are crafted using sustainable fibres or environmentally conscious processes, aimed at reducing their overall impact on the planet. These products support responsible manufacturing practices, such as the use of organic or recycled materials, water-saving techniques, and lower-emission production methods &mdash; all contributing to a more sustainable and ethical fashion industry.\";s:6:\"Arabic\";s:0:\"\";}'),
