or return shipping costs unless the item is defective or incorrect.</li>\r\n	<li>We recommend using a trackable shipping service as we are not liable for lost returns.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>Refunds</strong>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Once we receive and inspect your return, we&rsquo;ll notify you of the approval or rejection of your refund.</li>\r\n	<li>If approved, your refund will be processed within&nbsp;<strong>5&ndash;10 business days</strong>&nbsp;to your original payment method.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>Exchanges</strong><br />\r\nIf you need a different size or item, please request an exchange via customer support. We&rsquo;ll ship the replacement once we receive the returned item.\";}'),
(1835, 71, 'ldesc', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:509:\"Make a bold style statement with the Noir Garden Printed Kurta &mdash; a beautiful fusion of traditional motifs and modern flair. The intricate ivory floral and geometric patterns pop against the black base, while blush pink paneling and borders add a soft feminine contrast. Designed with flared sleeves featuring net cuffs and lace tie-ups, this kurta blends elegance with a hint of drama. Ideal for festive gatherings or elevated casual wear, pair it with straight trousers or culottes for a standout look.\";}'),
