-start=\"1663\">Damaged or Wrong Items</h2>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1846\" data-start=\"1691\">If you receive a damaged or incorrect item, please contact us immediately with photos, and we will arrange a replacement or full refund at no extra cost.</p>\r\n\";}'),
(2159, 224, 'ldesc', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:1488:\"<p data-end=\"563\" data-start=\"147\">Keep your little one cool and stylish with this <strong data-end=\"236\" data-start=\"214\">2-piece summer set</strong>, featuring a navy blue <strong data-end=\"279\" data-start=\"260\">printed T-shirt</strong> with a fun truck graphic and matching <strong data-end=\"339\" data-start=\"318\">drawstring shorts</strong>. Made from soft, breathable cotton, this outfit ensures comfort and ease of movement for all-day play. Perfect for casual outings, playdates, and warm-weather adventures, this set combines practicality with playful style.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"584\" data-start=\"565\"><strong data-end=\"582\" data-start=\"565\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"884\" data-start=\"585\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"642\" data-start=\"585\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"642\" data-start=\"587\">Set includes: <strong data-end=\"640\" data-start=\"601\">Printed T-shirt and matching shorts</strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"683\" data-start=\"643\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"683\" data-start=\"645\">Fabric: 100% soft, breathable cotton</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"742\" data-start=\"684\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"742\" data-start=\"686\">T-Shirt: Round neck, short sleeves, truck print design</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"816\" data-start=\"743\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"816\" data-start=\"745\">Shorts: Elastic waistband with adjustable drawstring for a secure fit</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"884\" data-start=\"817\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"884\" data-start=\"819\">Perfect for: Everyday wear, outdoor play, and summer activities</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\";}'),
