14 days</strong> of delivery, provided they are <strong data-end=\"962\" data-start=\"896\">unused, unwashed, and in original packaging with tags attached</strong>.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1140\" data-start=\"966\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"1140\" data-start=\"968\"><strong data-end=\"993\" data-start=\"968\">Non-Returnable Items:</strong> For hygiene reasons, certain items (e.g., undergarments, personalized/custom products, or sale items) are <strong data-end=\"1137\" data-start=\"1100\">non-returnable and non-refundable</strong>.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1385\" data-start=\"1141\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"1157\" data-start=\"1143\"><strong data-end=\"1155\" data-start=\"1143\">Process:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n	<ol data-end=\"1385\" data-start=\"1160\">\r\n		<li data-end=\"1235\" data-start=\"1160\">\r\n		<p data-end=\"1235\" data-start=\"1163\">Contact our support team with your order number and reason for return.</p>\r\n		</li>\r\n		<li data-end=\"1309\" data-start=\"1238\">\r\n		<p data-end=\"1309\" data-start=\"1241\">We will provide you with return instructions and shipping details.</p>\r\n		</li>\r\n		<li data-end=\"1385\" data-start=\"1312\">\r\n		<p data-end=\"1385\" data-start=\"1315\">Once received and inspected, a refund or exchange will be processed.</p>\r\n		</li>\r\n	</ol>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1525\" data-start=\"1386\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"1525\" data-start=\"1388\"><strong data-end=\"1408\" data-start=\"1388\">Return Shipping:</strong> Customers are responsible for return shipping costs unless the item received was damaged, defective, or incorrect.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1661\" data-start=\"1526\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"1661\" data-start=\"1528\"><strong data-end=\"1540\" data-start=\"1528\">Refunds:</strong> Refunds will be issued to the original payment method within <strong data-end=\"1623\" data-start=\"1602\">5&ndash;7 business days</strong> after we receive the returned item.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 data-end=\"1690\" data-start=\"1663\">Damaged or Wrong Items</h2>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1846\" data-start=\"1691\">If you receive a damaged or incorrect item, please contact us immediately with photos, and we will arrange a replacement or full refund at no extra cost.</p>\r\n\";}'),
(2201, 218, 'ldesc', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:1713:\"<p data-end=\"648\" data-start=\"154\">Dress your little one in casual elegance with this <strong data-end=\"249\" data-start=\"224\">3-piece muslin outfit</strong>, crafted for both comfort and style. The set features a lightweight <strong data-end=\"368\" data-start=\"318\">cream button-up shirt with front pocket detail</strong>, soft matching trousers with an elastic waistband, and a gentle <strong data-end=\"459\" data-start=\"433\">blue gingham inner tee</strong>. Perfect for everyday wear, playdates, or semi-formal occasions, this outfit keeps your baby cozy while looking smart. Paired with tiny leather shoes, it&rsquo;s an effortlessly charming look.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"669\" data-start=\"650\"><strong data-end=\"667\" data-start=\"650\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1023\" data-start=\"670\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"728\" data-start=\"670\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"728\" data-start=\"672\">Set includes: Button-up shirt, trousers, and inner tee</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"778\" data-start=\"729\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"778\" data-start=\"731\">Fabric: Soft and breathable <strong data-end=\"776\" data-start=\"759\">cotton muslin</strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"845\" data-start=\"779\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"845\" data-start=\"781\">Shirt: Cream color with button closure and front pocket design</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"904\" data-start=\"846\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"904\" data-start=\"848\">Pants: Elastic waistband for easy dressing and comfort</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"961\" data-start=\"905\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"961\" data-start=\"907\">Tee: Blue gingham pattern for a stylish layered look</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1023\" data-start=\"962\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"1023\" data-start=\"964\">Perfect for casual outings, gatherings, or special events</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\";}'),
