(2231, 200, 'ldesc', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:534:\"Step up your style with this <strong data-end=\"216\" data-start=\"175\">emerald green short-sleeve polo shirt</strong>, designed with a sleek half-zip front for a modern twist on a timeless classic. Featuring crisp white contrast detailing on the collar and sleeve edges, this polo brings a fresh and sophisticated look. Made from high-quality breathable fabric, it delivers all-day comfort while keeping you sharp and stylish. Perfect for smart-casual events, evenings out, or everyday wear, this versatile polo is a wardrobe essential.\";}'),
