(2237, 198, 'ldesc', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:519:\"Elevate your casual style with this <strong data-end=\"216\" data-start=\"183\">taupe short-sleeve polo shirt</strong>, designed with a modern half-zip closure for a sleek touch. Featuring a contrast white trim on the collar and sleeves, this shirt blends classic sophistication with contemporary minimalism. Crafted from premium breathable fabric, it ensures comfort and durability for all-day wear. Perfect for both casual outings and smart-casual occasions, this versatile polo adds effortless elegance to your wardrobe.\";}'),
