(2249, 202, 'ldesc', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:546:\"Refined and versatile, this <strong data-end=\"202\" data-start=\"173\">charcoal green polo shirt</strong> brings together timeless style and modern design. Featuring a sleek half-zip closure and white contrast detailing on the collar and sleeves, it offers a polished look with a contemporary edge. Crafted from premium breathable fabric, this shirt ensures lasting comfort whether you&rsquo;re dressing for a casual outing, a smart-casual event, or everyday wear. A must-have staple that pairs effortlessly with jeans, chinos, or tailored trousers.\";}'),
