(2285, 204, 'ldesc', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:575:\"Add a touch of refined elegance to your wardrobe with these <strong data-end=\"246\" data-start=\"219\">camel slim-fit trousers</strong>, crafted to balance style and comfort. Featuring a tailored silhouette with front crease detailing, these trousers exude a smart and polished look. The adjustable drawstring waistband provides modern versatility, allowing them to be styled for both casual and semi-formal occasions. Made from durable, breathable fabric, they offer all-day comfort while keeping you sharp. Pair with shirts, polos, or blazers for a sleek, contemporary outfit.\";}'),
