(2291, 203, 'ldesc', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:631:\"Upgrade your everyday style with these <strong data-end=\"227\" data-start=\"195\">light grey slim-fit trousers</strong>, designed for both comfort and sophistication. Featuring a modern tapered cut with a clean front crease, these trousers combine the elegance of formal wear with the ease of casual fashion. The adjustable drawstring waistband ensures a perfect fit, while side pockets add functionality. Crafted from breathable, lightweight fabric, they&rsquo;re ideal for all-day wear&mdash;whether at work, a casual outing, or a weekend gathering. Pair them with polos, shirts, or sneakers for a smart-casual look that stands out.\";}'),
(2292, 203, 'size_chart', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:1865:\"| Size | Chest (inches) | Chest (cm) | Shoulder (inches) | Shoulder (cm) | Length (inches) | Length (cm) |<br />\r\n| ---- | -------------- | ---------- | ----------------- | ------------- | --------------- | ----------- |<br />\r\n| S&nbsp; &nbsp; | 36 &ndash; 38&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; | 91 &ndash; 96&nbsp; &nbsp; | 17 &ndash; 18&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| 43 &ndash; 46&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| 27 &ndash; 28&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| 69 &ndash; 71&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;|<br />\r\n| M&nbsp; &nbsp; | 39 &ndash; 40&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; | 99 &ndash; 102&nbsp; &nbsp;| 18 &ndash; 19&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| 46 &ndash; 48&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| 28 &ndash; 29&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| 71 &ndash; 74&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;|<br />\r\n| L&nbsp; &nbsp; | 41 &ndash; 42&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; | 104 &ndash; 107&nbsp; | 19 &ndash; 20&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| 48 &ndash; 51&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| 29 &ndash; 30&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| 74 &ndash; 76&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;|<br />\r\n| XL&nbsp; &nbsp;| 43 &ndash; 44&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; | 109 &ndash; 112&nbsp; | 20 &ndash; 21&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| 51 &ndash; 53&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| 30 &ndash; 31&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| 76 &ndash; 79&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;|<br />\r\n| XXL&nbsp; | 45 &ndash; 47&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; | 114 &ndash; 119&nbsp; | 21 &ndash; 22&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| 53 &ndash; 56&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| 31 &ndash; 32&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| 79 &ndash; 81&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;|<br />\r\n| XXXL | 48 &ndash; 50&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; | 122 &ndash; 127&nbsp; | 22 &ndash; 23&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| 56 &ndash; 58&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| 32 &ndash; 33&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| 81 &ndash; 84&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;|\";}'),
