(2303, 182, 'ldesc', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:415:\"This stylish and comfy romper is perfect for everyday adventures. Made from soft, breathable cotton in a deep charcoal hue, it features a hooded design, wooden button front, and short sleeves for easy movement. The playful chest print adds a fun touch, while the relaxed fit keeps your little one cool and comfortable all day long. Ideal for playdates, outings, or casual wear. Suitable for toddlers and young kids.\";}'),
