(2315, 208, 'ldesc', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:588:\"Stay effortlessly stylish with these <strong data-end=\"232\" data-start=\"196\">beige textured slim-fit trousers</strong>, crafted for a modern smart-casual look. Featuring a subtle textured pattern, tailored fit, and front crease detailing, they bring sophistication to your everyday wear. The adjustable drawstring waistband ensures comfort and flexibility, while side pockets add functionality. Made from breathable, lightweight fabric, these trousers are perfect for work, weekend outings, or evening gatherings. Pair them with polos, shirts, or sneakers for a clean and versatile style.\";}'),
