(2321, 177, 'ldesc', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:399:\"A timeless piece crafted in soft ivory cotton, this baby dress features a delicate lace-trimmed ruffle neckline and charming bell sleeves. The lightweight, breathable fabric ensures all-day comfort, while the gathered skirt and dainty bow detail add a touch of elegance. Perfect for special occasions, photoshoots, or simply making everyday moments feel magical. Suitable for ages 6&ndash;24 months.\";}'),
