(2332, 69, 'return', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:2580:\"<strong>Shipping &amp; Returns Policy</strong><br />\r\n<strong>Shipping Policy</strong><br />\r\n<strong>Processing Time</strong><br />\r\nAll orders are processed within&nbsp;<strong>1-2 business days</strong>. Orders are not shipped or delivered on weekends or public holidays.<br />\r\n<strong>Shipping Time &amp; Rates</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>UAE Standard Shipping</strong>: 2&ndash;4 business days</li>\r\n	<li><strong>GCC Countries</strong>: 4&ndash;7 business days</li>\r\n	<li><strong>International Shipping</strong>: 7&ndash;14 business days</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nShipping rates are calculated at checkout based on your location and order weight. Free shipping may be available on eligible orders.<br />\r\n<strong>Order Tracking</strong><br />\r\nOnce your order is shipped, you will receive a confirmation email with a tracking number.<br />\r\n<strong>Delivery Delays</strong><br />\r\nDelays may occasionally occur due to high volume, customs, or unforeseen circumstances. We will notify you promptly in such cases.\r\n<div align=\"center\">\r\n<hr align=\"center\" noshade=\"noshade\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\" /></div>\r\n<strong>Returns &amp; Exchanges Policy</strong><br />\r\n<strong>Eligibility for Return</strong>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>You may request a return or exchange within&nbsp;<strong>7 days</strong>&nbsp;of receiving your order.</li>\r\n	<li>Items must be&nbsp;<strong>unused, unwashed</strong>, and in original packaging with tags attached.</li>\r\n	<li>Sale or discounted items are&nbsp;<strong>not eligible</strong>&nbsp;for return or exchange.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>How to Initiate a Return</strong><br />\r\nTo start a return, contact our customer support at&nbsp;<strong>info@meemseenindependent.com</strong>&nbsp;with your order number and reason for return. We will provide instructions for sending your item back.<br />\r\n<strong>Return Shipping</strong>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Customers are responsible for return shipping costs unless the item is defective or incorrect.</li>\r\n	<li>We recommend using a trackable shipping service as we are not liable for lost returns.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>Refunds</strong>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Once we receive and inspect your return, we&rsquo;ll notify you of the approval or rejection of your refund.</li>\r\n	<li>If approved, your refund will be processed within&nbsp;<strong>5&ndash;10 business days</strong>&nbsp;to your original payment method.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>Exchanges</strong><br />\r\nIf you need a different size or item, please request an exchange via customer support. We&rsquo;ll ship the replacement once we receive the returned item.<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp;\";}'),
(2333, 69, 'ldesc', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:1939:\"<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-2\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @[37rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @[72rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:32rem] @[34rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @[64rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto flex max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 text-base gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"group/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"5bb87971-45b6-4b37-a257-160c78620d80\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light\">\r\n<p data-end=\"677\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"170\">Step into effortless elegance with our <em data-end=\"262\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"233\">Tropical Bloom Cotton Kurta</em>. This vibrant teal piece features an all-over green foliage print, accented with a detailed border at the hem and sleeves. The relaxed, flowy silhouette and 3/4 sleeves offer both comfort and charm. Designed with a round neckline and tassel detail, it&#39;s perfect for pairing with white trousers or jeans. Made from breathable cotton fabric, this kurta is your go-to choice for a laid-back, yet polished summer look.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r