for return shipping costs unless the item is defective or incorrect.</li>\r\n	<li>We recommend using a trackable shipping service as we are not liable for lost returns.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>Refunds</strong>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Once we receive and inspect your return, we&rsquo;ll notify you of the approval or rejection of your refund.</li>\r\n	<li>If approved, your refund will be processed within&nbsp;<strong>5&ndash;10 business days</strong>&nbsp;to your original payment method.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>Exchanges</strong><br />\r\nIf you need a different size or item, please request an exchange via customer support. We&rsquo;ll ship the replacement once we receive the returned item.<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp;\";}'),
(2363, 170, 'ldesc', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:553:\"Step into timeless charm with our <em data-end=\"195\" data-start=\"169\">Vintage Bloom Midi Dress</em>. Featuring a soft floral print in earthy tones on a teal base, this dress radiates vintage-inspired elegance. The standout detail is its oversized white lace-trimmed Peter Pan collar with a delicate tie, adding a touch of romantic nostalgia. Designed in a relaxed fit with short sleeves and practical side pockets, it&#39;s perfect for both lounging in style or stepping out in effortless grace. Pair it with heels or flats for a versatile daytime look.\";}'),
