(2374, 157, 'return', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:4702:\"<h3 data-end=\"139\" data-start=\"106\"><strong data-end=\"139\" data-start=\"110\">Shipping &amp; Returns Policy</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<h4 data-end=\"165\" data-start=\"141\"><strong data-end=\"165\" data-start=\"146\">Shipping Policy</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"311\" data-start=\"167\"><strong data-end=\"186\" data-start=\"167\">Processing Time</strong><br data-end=\"189\" data-start=\"186\" />\r\nAll orders are processed within <strong data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"221\">1-2 business days</strong>. Orders are not shipped or delivered on weekends or public holidays.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"340\" data-start=\"313\"><strong data-end=\"338\" data-start=\"313\">Shipping Time &amp; Rates</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"481\" data-start=\"341\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"389\" data-start=\"341\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"389\" data-start=\"343\"><strong data-end=\"368\" data-start=\"343\">UAE Standard Shipping</strong>: 2&ndash;4 business days</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"430\" data-start=\"390\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"430\" data-start=\"392\"><strong data-end=\"409\" data-start=\"392\">GCC Countries</strong>: 4&ndash;7 business days</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"481\" data-start=\"431\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"481\" data-start=\"433\"><strong data-end=\"459\" data-start=\"433\">International Shipping</strong>: 7&ndash;14 business days</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"616\" data-start=\"483\">Shipping rates are calculated at checkout based on your location and order weight. Free shipping may be available on eligible orders.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"728\" data-start=\"618\"><strong data-end=\"636\" data-start=\"618\">Order Tracking</strong><br data-end=\"639\" data-start=\"636\" />\r\nOnce your order is shipped, you will receive a confirmation email with a tracking number.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"882\" data-start=\"730\"><strong data-end=\"749\" data-start=\"730\">Delivery Delays</strong><br data-end=\"752\" data-start=\"749\" />\r\nDelays may occasionally occur due to high volume, customs, or unforeseen circumstances. We will notify you promptly in such cases.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr data-end=\"887\" data-start=\"884\" />\r\n<h4 data-end=\"924\" data-start=\"889\"><strong data-end=\"924\" data-start=\"894\">Returns &amp; Exchanges Policy</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"954\" data-start=\"926\"><strong data-end=\"952\" data-start=\"926\">Eligibility for Return</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1196\" data-start=\"955\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1038\" data-start=\"955\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"1038\" data-start=\"957\">You may request a return or exchange within <strong data-end=\"1011\" data-start=\"1001\">7 days</strong> of receiving your order.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1124\" data-start=\"1039\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"1124\" data-start=\"1041\">Items must be <strong data-end=\"1075\" data-start=\"1055\">unused, unwashed</strong>, and in original packaging with tags attached.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1196\" data-start=\"1125\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"1196\" data-start=\"1127\">Sale or discounted items are <strong data-end=\"1172\" data-start=\"1156\">not eligible</strong> for return or exchange.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1420\" data-start=\"1198\"><strong data-end=\"1226\" data-start=\"1198\">How to Initiate a Return</strong><br data-end=\"1229\" data-start=\"1226\" />\r\nTo start a return, contact our customer support at <b>info@meemseenindependent.com&nbsp;</b>with your order number and reason for return. We will provide instructions for sending your item back.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1443\" data-start=\"1422\"><strong data-end=\"1441\" data-start=\"1422\">Return Shipping</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1631\" data-start=\"1444\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1542\" data-start=\"1444\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"1542\" data-start=\"1446\">Customers are responsible for return shipping costs unless the item is defective or incorrect.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1631\" data-start=\"1543\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"1631\" data-start=\"1545\">We recommend using a trackable shipping service as we are not liable for lost returns.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1646\" data-start=\"1633\"><strong data-end=\"1644\" data-start=\"1633\">Refunds</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1861\" data-start=\"1647\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1753\" data-start=\"1647\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"1753\" data-start=\"1649\">Once we receive and inspect your return, we&rsquo;ll notify you of the approval or rejection of your refund.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1861\" data-start=\"1754\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"1861\" data-start=\"1756\">If approved, your refund will be processed within <strong data-end=\"1828\" data-start=\"1806\">5&ndash;10 business days</strong> to your original payment method.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"2027\" data-start=\"1863\"><strong data-end=\"1876\" data-start=\"1863\">Exchanges</strong><br data-end=\"1879\" data-start=\"1876\" />\r\nIf you need a different size or item, please request an exchange via customer support. We&rsquo;ll ship the replacement once we receive the returned item.</p>\r\n\";}'),
(2375, 157, 'ldesc', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:1809:\"<p data-end=\"434\" data-start=\"170\">This flowy piece features a soothing sage green base adorned with delicate multicolor floral prints, evoking the freshness of a spring garden.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"694\" data-start=\"436\">The standout feature is the oversized white lace-trimmed collar with a front bow tie, blending retro elegance with modern ease. The shirt has a loose, flattering silhouette, complete with balloon sleeves and a softly ruffled hem for added movement and grace.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"823\" data-start=\"696\">Perfect for casual outings or semi-formal gatherings, this shirt pairs beautifully with embroidered trousers or tailored pants.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr data-end=\"828\" data-start=\"825\" />\r\n<p data-end=\"842\" data-start=\"830\"><strong data-end=\"842\" data-start=\"830\">Details:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1201\" data-start=\"843\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"882\" data-start=\"843\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"882\" data-start=\"845\">Color: Sage green with floral print</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"883\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"885\">Fabric: Lightweight, breathable cotton or lawn blend (please confirm)</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1011\" data-start=\"957\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"1011\" data-start=\"959\">Collar: Oversized white lace collar with front bow</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1054\" data-start=\"1012\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"1054\" data-start=\"1014\">Sleeves: Full-length with soft gathers</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1083\" data-start=\"1055\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"1083\" data-start=\"1057\">Hem: Ruffled bottom edge</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1106\" data-start=\"1084\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"1106\" data-start=\"1086\">Fit: Relaxed/Loose</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1201\" data-start=\"1107\">\r\n	<p data-end=\"1201\" data-start=\"1109\">Styling Tip: Style with neutral-toned bottoms and heels or sandals for a chic everyday look.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\";}'),
