(2423, 179, 'ldesc', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:436:\"Dress your young gentleman in timeless style with this elegant three-piece suit set. Featuring a tailored blazer with a subtle check pattern, matching vest, and trousers, this outfit is paired with a crisp white shirt and a sleek black bow tie. Perfect for weddings, parties, and special occasions, the soft yet structured fabric ensures comfort while keeping a polished, dapper look. Ideal for boys who love to look sharp and charming.\";}'),
