(2549, 251, 'ldesc', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:402:\"<p>Natural switch between breast and bottle &ndash; based on 70+ years of breastfeeding research for a natural sucking motion</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Latch-on line, wide neck, and gently curved nipple for a secure latch</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Softness, flexibility, and elasticity similar to a mother&rsquo;s nipple**</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Built-in Anti-Colic System</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Six sizes available to match your baby&rsquo;s development</p>\r\n\";}'),
