(2645, 210, 'ldesc', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:568:\"Dress your little one in timeless elegance with this beautifully crafted frock, made from a premium <strong data-end=\"256\" data-start=\"233\">blended wool fabric</strong>. Featuring delicate layered lace detailing on the bodice and charming bell sleeves, this dress combines warmth with a soft, breathable feel for all-day comfort. The gentle neutral shade gives it a sophisticated look, perfect for special occasions, family gatherings, or memorable photo sessions. Paired with cozy socks and matching shoes, this frock offers both style and comfort for your baby girl.\";}'),
