(2663, 214, 'ldesc', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:514:\"A timeless piece for your little one, this <strong data-end=\"222\" data-start=\"199\">cream knitted frock</strong> features a delicate lace-textured design with a soft <strong data-end=\"296\" data-start=\"276\">Peter Pan collar</strong> outlined in black piping and finished with a sweet ribbon bow. The long sleeves provide warmth and comfort, making it ideal for both everyday wear and special occasions. Crafted from soft, breathable fabric, this frock ensures your baby stays cozy while looking effortlessly elegant.\";}'),
