(2719, 280, 'ldesc', 'a:1:{s:7:\"English\";s:4664:\"<div class=\"desc_holder\">\r\n                        <p>Century Paper & Board Mills Limited (CPBM) is Pakistan\'s premium manufacturer and market leader in high-quality packaging boards. Our state-of-the-art integrated mills produce versatile, reliable packaging board products tailored for demanding printing and converting requirements.</p>\r\n                        \r\n                        <h3>Coated Duplex Boards</h3>\r\n                        <p>Multi-layer paperboard featuring a coated white top surface and a grey or white back. Widely used for high-quality packaging of pharmaceuticals, consumer goods, food products, stationery, and household items where superior printability and visual appeal are required.</p>\r\n                        \r\n                        <h3>Folding Box Board (FBB)</h3>\r\n                        <p>Premium-grade virgin fiber board with a smooth coated surface, offering excellent strength, stiffness, and print quality. Ideal for luxury packaging, cosmetics, pharmaceuticals, food cartons, and premium consumer products.</p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"fn_cs_check_list\">\r\n                        <h3>Key Specifications & Features</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"list\">\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>\r\n                                    <div class=\"item\">\r\n                                        <img class=\"fn__svg\" src=\"svg/check.svg\" alt=\"svg\" />\r\n                                        <p>Superior surface smoothness and print gloss for offset, gravure, and flexographic printing</p>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </li>\r\n                                <li>\r\n                                    <div class=\"item\">\r\n                                        <img class=\"fn__svg\" src=\"svg/check.svg\" alt=\"svg\" />\r\n                                        <p>High stiffness and cross-direction strength for premium box integrity and transit durability</p>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </li>\r\n                                <li>\r\n                                    <div class=\"item\">\r\n                                        <img class=\"fn__svg\" src=\"svg/check.svg\" alt=\"svg\" />\r\n                                        <p>FSCâ„¢ Chain-of-Custody certification supporting eco-friendly and sustainable packaging</p>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </li>\r\n                                <li>\r\n                                    <div class=\"item\">\r\n                                        <img class=\"fn__svg\" src=\"svg/check.svg\" alt=\"svg\" />\r\n                                        <p>Food-grade certified formulations, ideal for direct and indirect food contact packaging</p>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </li>\r\n                                <li>\r\n                                    <div class=\"item\">\r\n                                        <img class=\"fn__svg\" src=\"svg/check.svg\" alt=\"svg\" />\r\n                                        <p>Excellent scoring, folding, and die-cutting properties to prevent cracking at the creases</p>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </li>\r\n                                <li>\r\n                                    <div class=\"item\">\r\n                                        <img class=\"fn__svg\" src=\"svg/check.svg\" alt=\"svg\" />\r\n                                        <p>Available in Clay Coated Duplex Board (White & Grey Back) and Solid Bleached Board</p>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </li>\r\n                            </ul>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"fn_cs_call_to_action corner\">\r\n                        <div class=\"container\">\r\n                            <div class=\"cta_holder\">\r\n                                <div class=\"title_holder\">\r\n                                    <h3>Century Paper & Board Mills</h3>\r\n                                    <p>Partner with Pakistan\'s market leader for your custom packaging board needs.</p>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"link_holder\">\r\n                                    <a href=\"contact.php\">Inquire Now</a>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div data-html=\"includes/random-service.html\" data-index=\"1\" data-count=\"2\"></div>\";}'),
