             <img class=\"fn__svg\" src=\"svg/check.svg\" alt=\"svg\" />\r\n                                        <p>Pure virgin pulp formulations conforming to strict food-grade packaging rules</p>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </li>\r\n                                <li>\r\n                                    <div class=\"item\">\r\n                                        <img class=\"fn__svg\" src=\"svg/check.svg\" alt=\"svg\" />\r\n                                        <p>Available in diverse grammages (GSM parameters) tailored to industrial order volumes</p>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </li>\r\n                            </ul>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <!-- Check List Shortcode -->\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Call to Action Shortcode (with corner) -->\r\n                    <div class=\"fn_cs_call_to_action corner\">\r\n                        <div class=\"container\">\r\n                            <div class=\"cta_holder\">\r\n                                <div class=\"title_holder\">\r\n                                    <h3>Century Paper & Board Mills</h3>\r\n                                    <p>Find the right high-performance paper specifications for your commercial systems.</p>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"link_holder\">\r\n                                    <a href=\"contact.php\">Inquire Now</a>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\";}'),
